    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the animal world in this fun, family-friendly game for kids and adults. Sit back and relax and exercise your memory by finding all animal pairs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage contains many pairs, each with a different pattern or pose. Your objective is to match all pairs in each stage to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN ART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play across seven stages all with hand-drawn art. Each stage features a different animal, from beautiful carp to wild giraffes and some of the most famous house pets. Unleash each stage's colors, and earn achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336370/extras/81f881d33fa047aed9812973fbf41a3e.avif?t=1740704274\" width=612 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU ARE IN CONTROL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has full controller support. Play and have fun from the comfort of your couch. Do you like playing at your desk? Use your keyboard and mouse to play with simple intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing at night? Change the background color to a different one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336370/extras/1cf3b66a74df159181d3cdbfbecc006f.avif?t=1740704274\" width=612 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WANT A BIT MORE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel like playing again, randomize the positions of the animals to an extra challenge, or activate the stop-watch mode and see how fast you beat each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the animal world in this fun, family-friendly game for kids and adults. Sit back and relax and exercise your memory by finding all animal pairs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage contains many pairs, each with a different pattern or pose. Your objective is to match all pairs in each stage to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN ART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play across seven stages all with hand-drawn art. Each stage features a different animal, from beautiful carp to wild giraffes and some of the most famous house pets. Unleash each stage's colors, and earn achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336370/extras/81f881d33fa047aed9812973fbf41a3e.avif?t=1740704274\" width=612 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU ARE IN CONTROL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has full controller support. Play and have fun from the comfort of your couch. Do you like playing at your desk? Use your keyboard and mouse to play with simple intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing at night? Change the background color to a different one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336370/extras/1cf3b66a74df159181d3cdbfbecc006f.avif?t=1740704274\" width=612 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WANT A BIT MORE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel like playing again, randomize the positions of the animals to an extra challenge, or activate the stop-watch mode and see how fast you beat each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
